silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_02_eight_corners_atlas_concrete_anchor_0#corner_000 silm:hasLongDescription "The Corner_000 is [virtual, class, classification]: type-system designer with abstract class hierarchies -- Cat -> Mammal -> Animal as type-class chain. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Corner_000', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
